{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Holy it shall be.</b> His hair — to grow the wild growth of the hair of his head (Sifrei; Ta'anit 11)." "<b>Wild growth.</b> Vowelized with a small patach even though it is joined to 'hair of his head' — פֶּרַע of hair. And the meaning of פֶּרַע: growing of hair. And so ״אֶת רֹאשׁוֹ לֹא יִפְרָע״ (Leviticus 21). And that which is less than thirty days is not called פֶּרַע (Sifrei; Sanhedrin 22)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:39.888509870Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}